<title>GERMANY: Thai Airways opens Internet home page.</title>
<headline>Thai Airways opens Internet home page.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thai Airways International Plc said it has opened an Internet home page featuring a wide range of corporate information.</p>
<p>Flight schedules, ticket prices, details of alliances with partners and holiday information on Thailand and Asia are included, a statement issued here said.</p>
<p>The cargo site gives information on air cargo services and facilities, and contact numbers for the airline's cargo sales offices worldwide. - Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+44 171 542 5017</p>
